# Command and output copied verbatim from the session log; timestamps and dates removed. Paths shortened:
#   <workdir> = folder holding the data files and scripts; <venv> = the Python environment; <other-project> = an unrelated project folder.

$ cd <workdir> && curl -sL -A "research-reader/0.1" -r 0-1200000000 https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenMOSS-Team/SciJudgeBench/resolve/main/train.jsonl -o train_part.jsonl; ls -la train_part.jsonl; wc -l train_part.jsonl; python3 -c "
import json
n=0;yrs={}
for l in open('train_part.jsonl'):
  try: r=json.loads(l)
  except: continue
  n+=1; yrs[r.get('year')]=yrs.get(r.get('year'),0)+1
print(n, sorted(yrs.items())[:40])"

